@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
title E03: running recuerda START entre ticks

binary "start" as S
binary "stop" as P
binary "running (anterior)" as R
binary "running' = pump" as N

@1
S is low
P is low
R is low
N is low

@2
S is high
N is high

@3
S is low
R is high

@4
S is high
P is high
N is low

@5
S is low
P is low
R is low

@6

highlight 2 to 3 : autorretención
highlight 4 to 5 : gana el paro
@enduml
